    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Home With Room to Enjoy Life.\r\n\r\nSome homes just feel right for family life.\r\n\r\nA detached house. A garden with room to play. Mature trees around you. Two living rooms inside. And a garage for everything that never seems to fit in the house.\r\n\r\nThat is what you have here at Dunaree.\r\n\r\nSet on approximately 0.52 acres, this three-bedroom detached home offers a practical family layout, a mature garden and a countryside setting just two minutes from Kingscourt Main Street.\r\n\r\nThe garden is one of the real highlights.\r\n\r\nMature trees and established planting give the property privacy and shelter, while the lawns offer plenty of room for children to play, summer evenings outside or simply enjoying the space around the house.\r\n\r\nInside, the layout works well.\r\n\r\nThere are two separate reception rooms, giving you a main sitting room and a second space that can work as a family room, playroom, home office or whatever suits your needs.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen and dining area is bright and well placed for everyday family life.\r\n\r\nOne of the three bedrooms is located on the ground floor, along with a bathroom. Upstairs are two further bedrooms and a second bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, the detached garage provides useful storage or workshop space, while there is plenty of parking around the property.\r\n\r\nThe location adds to the appeal.\r\n\r\nYou have the peace of a countryside setting, but everyday life is close by. Kingscourt Main Street is just a two-minute drive away, with schools, shops, cafés, sports clubs and local services all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nFor families looking for more room inside and out, or buyers who want a detached home close to Kingscourt, this is a property that is well worth seeing.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\nThree-bedroom detached home\r\nTwo bathrooms\r\nApprox. 0.52-acre site\r\nGround floor bedroom\r\nTwo separate reception rooms\r\nBright kitchen and dining area\r\nDetached garage\r\nMature gardens with established trees\r\nCountryside setting\r\nJust two minutes from Kingscourt Main Street"
      },
